Third-party notices for @arrzdev/adaptv
======================================

adaptv studies and, in places, ports logic from other open-source projects. This file carries the
required notices. Per-file provenance comments (a pinned-SHA permalink plus a `Why:` line) are the
convention — see docs/PRIOR-ART.md §0.

None of the projects below are runtime dependencies of adaptv. They are listed because adaptv's source
either ports their logic or derives tuning constants and techniques from it.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
vaul — https://github.com/emilkowalski/vaul
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Used by: src/components/drawer/*

adaptv's Drawer began as a wrap of vaul, was patched on top, and is now an independent
implementation. What remains is derived tuning (drag dampening, the iOS sheet easing curve,
snap-point and nested-scroll arbitration behaviour), documented inline at each site.

